  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "44d25379-73d6-4ceb-aa4e-1d7cbb45cb0c",
    "name": "Booking flow",
    "description": "This collection demonstrates the appointment booking workflow across the Scheduling and Billing services.\n\nRun the requests in this order:\n\n1. Set a working schedule for the doctor.\n    \n2. Create the doctor's pricing profile.\n    \n3. Book an appointment.\n    \n4. Query the draft invoice associated with the appointment.\n    \n\nExpected outcome: a scheduled appointment and an associated draft invoice. Payment is handled separately in the Payment flow collection.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "57059525"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Set a working schedule",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "// Generates a random UUID for this test run\r\npm.environment.set(\"doctorId\", \"doc-\" + pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}'));\r\n"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\r\n  \"validFrom\": \"2026-10-06\",\r\n  \"shifts\": {\r\n    \"MONDAY\": [{\"startTime\": \"09:00:00\", \"endTime\": \"17:30:00\"}],\r\n    \"TUESDAY\": [{\"startTime\": \"09:00:00\", \"endTime\": \"17:00:00\"}],\r\n    \"WEDNESDAY\": [{\"startTime\": \"09:00:00\", \"endTime\": \"12:00:00\"}],\r\n    \"THURSDAY\": [{\"startTime\": \"09:00:00\", \"endTime\": \"17:00:00\"}],\r\n    \"FRIDAY\": [{\"startTime\": \"09:00:00\", \"endTime\": \"12:00:00\"},{\"startTime\": \"15:00:00\", \"endTime\": \"17:00:00\"}],\r\n    \"SATURDAY\": [],\r\n    \"SUNDAY\": []\r\n  }\r\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{scheduling_url}}/api/calendars/{{doctorId}}/schedules",
          "host": [
            "{{scheduling_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "calendars",
            "{{doctorId}}",
            "schedules"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Sets the doctor’s weekly working hours in the Scheduling service. Run this request first in the Booking flow.\n\n**Before sending**\n\n- Start the Scheduling service and its required infrastructure.\n    \n- Select your local Postman environment.\n    \n- Set `scheduling_url` to the Scheduling service’s base URL, such as `http://localhost:8080`.\n    \n\n**Doctor identifier**\n\nThe pre-request script generates a new test `doctorId` and saves it in the selected environment. Later requests use this identifier to create the pricing profile and book an appointment for the same doctor.\n\nSending this request again generates a different doctor ID and starts a new test setup.\n\n**Request body**\n\n- `validFrom`: the date from which the weekly schedule applies and it must be roday or in the future.\n    \n- `shifts`: working periods for each weekday, with `startTime` and `endTime`.\n    \n- An empty list means the doctor does not work that day.\n    \n- Multiple periods allow breaks between shifts.\n    \n\n**Expected result**\n\n`201 Created`, with the saved schedule in the response.\n\nThe appointment booked later must be on or after `validFrom`, and its full duration must fit within a working period.\n\n**Next step**\n\nRun **Create pricing profile** using the same environment and generated `doctorId`."
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "Working schedule created",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\r\n  \"validFrom\": \"2026-10-06\",\r\n  \"shifts\": {\r\n    \"MONDAY\": [{\"startTime\": \"09:00:00\", \"endTime\": \"17:30:00\"}],\r\n    \"TUESDAY\": [{\"startTime\": \"09:00:00\", \"endTime\": \"17:00:00\"}],\r\n    \"WEDNESDAY\": [{\"startTime\": \"09:00:00\", \"endTime\": \"12:00:00\"}],\r\n    \"THURSDAY\": [{\"startTime\": \"09:00:00\", \"endTime\": \"17:00:00\"}],\r\n    \"FRIDAY\": [{\"startTime\": \"09:00:00\", \"endTime\": \"12:00:00\"},{\"startTime\": \"15:00:00\", \"endTime\": \"17:00:00\"}],\r\n    \"SATURDAY\": [],\r\n    \"SUNDAY\": []\r\n  }\r\n}",
              "options": {
