    {
      "name": "Create pricing profile",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\r\n  \"doctorId\": \"{{doctorId}}\",\r\n  \"currency\": \"USD\",\r\n  \"hourlyRate\": 50.00\r\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{billing_url}}/api/profile/create",
          "host": [
            "{{billing_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "profile",
            "create"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Creates a doctor’s pricing profile in the Billing service.\n\nRun this after **Set a working schedule**, using the same Postman environment. The request uses the `doctorId` generated by that earlier step.\n\n**Prerequisites**\n\n- The Billing service and its required infrastructure are running.\n    \n- `billing_url` points to the Billing service.\n    \n- `doctorId` is set in the selected environment.\n    \n\n**Request body**\n\n- `doctorId`: the doctor whose pricing profile is being created.\n    \n- `currency`: the currency used for billing; this example uses `USD`.\n    \n- `hourlyRate`: the doctor’s hourly rate; this example uses `50`.\n    \n\nThis profile supplies the pricing information for billing the doctor’s appointments."
      },
