    {
      "name": "Query draft invoice",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{billing_url}}/api/queries/invoices/appointment/{{appointmentId}}/status",
          "host": [
            "{{billing_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "queries",
            "invoices",
            "appointment",
            "{{appointmentId}}",
            "status"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Retrieves the invoice status for the appointment created in the previous step.\n\n**Prerequisites**\n\n- The Billing service and its required infrastructure are running.\n    \n- `billing_url` points to the Billing service.\n    \n- `appointmentId` was saved by the **Book an appointment** request.\n    \n\n**Request**  \nUses `appointmentId` in the URL to query the associated invoice. No request body is required.\n\n**Expected outcome**  \nThe response shows that a draft invoice exists for the appointment.\n\nInvoice creation happens asynchronously after Billing receives the booking event. If the invoice is not available immediately, wait briefly and send this query again.\n\nThis completes the booking flow: configuring the doctor’s schedule and pricing, booking an appointment, and verifying the resulting proforma invoice."
      },
